msgid "Temporary Euler may be changed implicitly!"
msgstr "ຄ່າ Euler ຊົ່ວຄາວອາດຈະຖືກປ່ຽນແປງໂດຍທາງອ້ອມ!"

msgid ""
"Temporary Euler will not be stored in the object with the original value. "
"Instead, it will be stored as Quaternion with irreversible conversion.\n"
"This is due to the fact that the result of Euler->Quaternion can be "
"determined uniquely, but the result of Quaternion->Euler can be multi-"
"existent."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າ Euler ຊົ່ວຄາວຈະບໍ່ຖືກບັນທຶກໃນ Object ດ້ວຍຄ່າເດີມ ແຕ່ຈະຖືກບັນທຶກເປັນ Quaternion ແທນ.\n"
"ເນື່ອງຈາກການແປງຈາກ Euler ໄປເປັນ Quaternion ນັ້ນຊັດເຈນ, ແຕ່ຈາກ Quaternion ກັບມາເປັນ "
"Euler ອາດຈະມີໄດ້ຫຼາຍຄ່າ."

