msgstr "ຕົວປະມວນຜົນພາບ (Renderer):"

msgid "More information"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ"

msgid ""
"RenderingDevice-based methods not available on this GPU:\n"
"%s\n"
"Please use the Compatibility renderer."
msgstr ""
"ວິທີການແບບ RenderingDevice ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບ GPU ນີ້:\n"
"%s\n"
"ກະລຸນາໃຊ້ຕົວປະມວນຜົນແບບ Compatibility."

msgid "The renderer can be changed later, but scenes may need to be adjusted."
msgstr "ສາມາດປ່ຽນ Renderer ໄດ້ໃນພາຍຫຼັງ, ແຕ່ອາດຈະຕ້ອງໄດ້ປັບແຕ່ງສາກໃໝ່."

msgid "Version Control Metadata:"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາດາຕ້າການຄວບຄຸມເວີຊັນ (Version Control):"

msgid "Git"
msgstr "Git"

