msgstr "Layer ທີ່ກຳລັງແກ້ໄຂຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ ຫຼື ບໍ່ເຫັນ"

msgid ""
"The edited TileMap or TileMapLayer node has no TileSet resource.\n"
"Create or load a TileSet resource in the Tile Set property in the inspector."
msgstr ""
"ໂນດ TileMap ຫຼື TileMapLayer ທີ່ກຳລັງແກ້ໄຂບໍ່ມີ TileSet resource.\n"
"ກະລຸນາສ້າງ ຫຼື ໂຫລດ TileSet resource ໃນຄຸນສົມບັດ Tile Set ໃນ inspector."

msgid "TileMap"
msgstr "TileMap"

msgid "Open TileMap Dock"
msgstr "ເປີດແຖບ TileMap"

msgid "Select Next Tile Map Layer"
msgstr "ເລືອກ Tile Map Layer ຖັດໄປ"

