msgstr "ສ້າງ Debug Tangents"

msgid "No mesh to unwrap."
msgstr "ບໍ່ມີເມັສທີ່ຈະອັນແຣັບ (unwrap)."

msgid ""
"Mesh cannot unwrap UVs because it does not belong to the edited scene. Make "
"it unique first."
msgstr ""
"ເມັສບໍ່ສາມາດອັນແຣັບ UV ໄດ້ ເນື່ອງຈາກມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ເປັນຂອງສາກທີ່ກຳລັງແກ້ໄຂຢູ່. ກະລຸນາເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນເປັນເອກະລັກ "
"(unique) ກ່ອນ."

msgid ""
"Mesh cannot unwrap UVs because it belongs to another resource which was "
"imported from another file type. Make it unique first."
msgstr ""
"ເມັສບໍ່ສາມາດອັນແຣັບ UV ໄດ້ ເນື່ອງຈາກມັນເປັນຂອງຊັບພະຍາກອນອື່ນທີ່ຖືກນຳເຂົ້າຈາກ ໄຟລ໌ປະເພດອື່ນ. "
"ກະລຸນາເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນເປັນເອກະລັກ (unique) ກ່ອນ."

msgid ""
"Mesh cannot unwrap UVs because it was imported from another file type. Make "
"it unique first."
msgstr ""
"ເມັສບໍ່ສາມາດອັນແຣັບ UV ໄດ້ ເນື່ອງຈາກມັນຖືກນຳເຂົ້າຈາກໄຟລ໌ປະເພດອື່ນ. ກະລຸນາເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນເປັນເອກະລັກ "
"(unique) ກ່ອນ."

msgid "Unwrap UV2"
msgstr "Unwrap UV2"

msgid "Contained Mesh is not of type ArrayMesh."
msgstr "ເມັສທີ່ມີຢູ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ເປັນປະເພດ ArrayMesh."

msgid "Can't unwrap mesh with blend shapes."
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດອັນແຣັບເມັສທີ່ມີ blend shapes ໄດ້."

msgid "Only triangles are supported for lightmap unwrap."
msgstr "ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະຮູບສາມແຈ (triangles) ເທົ່ານັ້ນສຳລັບການອັນແຣັບ lightmap."

msgid "Normals are required for lightmap unwrap."
msgstr "ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີ Normals ສຳລັບການອັນແຣັບ lightmap."

msgid "UV Unwrap failed, mesh may not be manifold?"
msgstr "ການອັນແຣັບ UV ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ, ເມັສອາດຈະບໍ່ເປັນ manifold?"

msgid "No mesh to debug."
msgstr "ບໍ່ມີເມັສທີ່ຈະ debug."

msgid "Mesh has no UV in layer %d."
msgstr "ເມັສບໍ່ມີ UV ໃນເລເຍີ %d."

msgid "Create Navigation Mesh"
msgstr "ສ້າງ Navigation Mesh"

msgid "MeshInstance3D lacks a Mesh."
msgstr "MeshInstance3D ບໍ່ມີເມັສ (Mesh)."

msgid "Mesh has no surface to create outlines from."
msgstr "ເມັສບໍ່ມີພື້ນຜິວ (surface) ທີ່ຈະສ້າງເສັ້ນຂອບ (outlines) ໄດ້."

msgid "Mesh primitive type is not PRIMITIVE_TRIANGLES."
msgstr "ປະເພດ primitive ຂອງເມັສບໍ່ແມ່ນ PRIMITIVE_TRIANGLES."

msgid "Could not create outline."
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດສ້າງເສັ້ນຂອບໄດ້."

msgid "Create Outline"
msgstr "ສ້າງເສັ້ນຂອບ"

msgid "Mesh"
msgstr "ເມັສ (Mesh)"

msgid "Create Collision Shape..."
msgstr "ສ້າງຮູບຊົງຄໍລິຊັນ..."

msgid "Create Outline Mesh..."
msgstr "ສ້າງ Outline Mesh..."

msgid ""
"Creates a static outline mesh. The outline mesh will have its normals flipped "
"automatically.\n"
"This can be used instead of the StandardMaterial Grow property when using "
"that property isn't possible."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ outline mesh ແບບຄົງທີ່. Outline mesh ນີ້ຈະຖືກພິກ normals ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ.\n"
"ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ແທນຄຸນສົມບັດ Grow ຂອງ StandardMaterial ໄດ້ເມື່ອບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດນັ້ນໄດ້."

msgid "View UV1"
msgstr "ເບິ່ງ UV1"

msgid "View UV2"
msgstr "ເບິ່ງ UV2"

msgid "Unwrap UV2 for Lightmap/AO"
msgstr "Unwrap UV2 ສຳລັບ Lightmap/AO"

msgid "Create Outline Mesh"
msgstr "ສ້າງ Outline Mesh"

msgid "Outline Size:"
msgstr "ຂະໜາດເສັ້ນຂອບ:"

msgid "Create Collision Shape"
msgstr "ສ້າງຮູບຊົງຄໍລິຊັນ"

msgid "Collision Shape Placement"
msgstr "ການຈັດວາງຮູບຊົງຄໍລິຊັນ"

msgid "Sibling"
msgstr "Sibling"

msgid "Creates collision shapes as Sibling."
msgstr "ສ້າງຮູບຊົງຄໍລິຊັນເປັນ Sibling."

msgid "Static Body Child"
msgstr "Static Body Child"

msgid "Creates a StaticBody3D as child and assigns collision shapes to it."
msgstr "ສ້າງ StaticBody3D ເປັນ child ແລະ ກຳນົດຮູບຊົງຄໍລິຊັນໃຫ້ກັບມັນ."

msgid "Collision Shape Type"
msgstr "ປະເພດຮູບຊົງຄໍລິຊັນ"

msgid ""
"Creates a polygon-based collision shape.\n"
"This is the most accurate (but slowest) option for collision detection."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງຮູບຊົງຄໍລິຊັນແບບໂພລີກອນ (polygon-based).\n"
"ນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວເລືອກທີ່ມີຄວາມຊັດເຈນທີ່ສຸດ (ແຕ່ຊ້າທີ່ສຸດ) ສຳລັບການກວດສອບການຕຳ."

msgid ""
"Creates a single convex collision shape.\n"
"This is the faster than the trimesh or multiple convex option, but is less "
"accurate for collision detection."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງຮູບຊົງຄໍລິຊັນແບບ convex ອັນດຽວ.\n"
"ສິ່ງນີ້ໄວກວ່າຕົວເລືອກ trimesh ຫຼື multiple convex, ແຕ່ມີຄວາມຊັດເຈນໜ້ອຍກວ່າ "
"ສຳລັບການກວດສອບການຕຳ."

msgid ""
"Creates a simplified convex collision shape.\n"
"This is similar to single collision shape, but can result in a simpler "
"geometry in some cases, at the cost of accuracy."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງຮູບຊົງຄໍລິຊັນແບບ convex ທີ່ຫຼຸດລາຍລະອຽດລົງ.\n"
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຄ້າຍຄືກັບຮູບຊົງ convex ອັນດຽວ, ແຕ່ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ໄດ້ຮູບຊົງທີ່ລຽບງ່າຍກວ່າໃນບາງກໍລະນີ, "
"ໂດຍແລກກັບຄວາມຊັດເຈນທີ່ຫຼຸດລົງ."

msgid ""
"Creates multiple convex collision shapes. These are decomposed from the "
"original mesh.\n"
"This is a performance and accuracy middle-ground between a single convex "
"collision and a polygon-based trimesh collision."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງຮູບຊົງຄໍລິຊັນແບບ convex ຫຼາຍອັນ. ສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຖືກແຍກອອກມາຈາກເມັສຕົ້ນສະບັບ.\n"
"ນີ້ແມ່ນທາງເລືອກທີ່ຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງຄວາມໄວ ແລະ ຄວາມຊັດເຈນ."

msgid ""
"Creates an bounding box collision shape.\n"
"This will use the mesh's AABB if the shape is not a built-in BoxMesh.\n"
"This is faster than the convex collision shape option for collision detection."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງຮູບຊົງຄໍລິຊັນແບບ bounding box.\n"
"ຈະໃຊ້ AABB ຂອງເມັສ ຫາກຮູບຊົງນັ້ນບໍ່ແມ່ນ BoxMesh ທີ່ມີມາໃຫ້ແລ້ວ.\n"
"ສິ່ງນີ້ໄວກວ່າຕົວເລືອກຮູບຊົງ convex ສຳລັບການກວດສອບການຕຳ."

msgid ""
"Creates a capsule collision shape.\n"
"This will use the mesh's AABB if the shape is not a built-in CapsuleMesh.\n"
"This is faster than the convex collision shape option for collision detection."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງຮູບຊົງຄໍລິຊັນແບບແຄັບຊູນ.\n"
"ຈະໃຊ້ AABB ຂອງເມັສ ຫາກຮູບຊົງນັ້ນບໍ່ແມ່ນ CapsuleMesh ທີ່ມີມາໃຫ້ແລ້ວ.\n"
"ສິ່ງນີ້ໄວກວ່າຕົວເລືອກຮູບຊົງ convex ສຳລັບການກວດສອບການຕຳ."

msgid ""
"Creates a cylinder collision shape.\n"
"This will use the mesh's AABB if the shape is not a built-in CylinderMesh.\n"
"This is faster than the convex collision shape option for collision detection."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງຮູບຊົງຄໍລິຊັນແບບທໍ່ກົມ.\n"
"ຈະໃຊ້ AABB ຂອງເມັສ ຫາກຮູບຊົງນັ້ນບໍ່ແມ່ນ CylinderMesh ທີ່ມີມາໃຫ້ແລ້ວ.\n"
"ສິ່ງນີ້ໄວກວ່າຕົວເລືອກຮູບຊົງ convex ສຳລັບການກວດສອບການຕຳ."

msgid ""
"Creates a sphere collision shape.\n"
"This will use the mesh's AABB if the shape is not a built-in SphereMesh.\n"
"This is faster than the convex collision shape option for collision detection."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງຮູບຊົງຄໍລິຊັນແບບວົງມົນ.\n"
"ຈະໃຊ້ AABB ຂອງເມັສ ຫາກຮູບຊົງນັ້ນບໍ່ແມ່ນ SphereMesh ທີ່ມີມາໃຫ້ແລ້ວ.\n"
"ສິ່ງນີ້ໄວກວ່າຕົວເລືອກຮູບຊົງ convex ສຳລັບການກວດສອບການຕຳ."

msgid ""
"Creates a box, capsule, cylinder, or sphere primitive collision shape if the "
"mesh is a primitive.\n"
"The mesh must use the built-in BoxMesh, CapsuleMesh, CylinderMesh, or "
"SphereMesh primitive.\n"
"This is faster than the convex collision shape option for collision detection."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງຮູບຊົງຄໍລິຊັນແບບພື້ນຖານ (ກ່ອງ, ແຄັບຊູນ, ທໍ່ກົມ, ຫຼື ວົງມົນ) ຫາກເມັສນັ້ນເປັນແບບ primitive.\n"
"ເມັສຕ້ອງໃຊ້ BoxMesh, CapsuleMesh, CylinderMesh, ຫຼື SphereMesh ທີ່ມີມາໃຫ້.\n"
"ສິ່ງນີ້ໄວກວ່າຕົວເລືອກຮູບຊົງ convex ສຳລັບການກວດສອບການຕຳ."

msgid "Alignment Axis"
msgstr "ແກນຈັດວາງ"

msgid "Longest Axis"
msgstr "ແກນທີ່ຍາວທີ່ສຸດ"

msgid "Create the shape along the longest axis of the mesh's AABB."
msgstr "ສ້າງຮູບຊົງຕາມແກນທີ່ຍາວທີ່ສຸດຂອງ AABB ຂອງເມັສ."

msgid "X-Axis"
msgstr "ແກນ X"

msgid "Create the shape along the local X-Axis."
msgstr "ສ້າງຮູບຊົງຕາມແກນ X ຂອງທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (local)."

msgid "Y-Axis"
msgstr "ແກນ Y"

msgid "Create the shape along the local Y-Axis."
msgstr "ສ້າງຮູບຊົງຕາມແກນ Y ຂອງທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (local)."

msgid "Z-Axis"
msgstr "ແກນ Z"

msgid "Create the shape along the local Z-Axis."
msgstr "ສ້າງຮູບຊົງຕາມແກນ Z ຂອງທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (local)."

msgid "UV Channel Debug"
msgstr "Debug ຊ່ອງ UV"

msgid "Create NavigationMesh"
msgstr "ສ້າງ NavigationMesh"

msgid ""
"Before converting a rendering mesh to a navigation mesh, please verify:\n"
"\n"
"- The mesh is two-dimensional.\n"
"- The mesh has no surface overlap.\n"
"- The mesh has no self-intersection.\n"
"- The mesh surfaces have indices.\n"
"\n"
"If the mesh does not fulfill these requirements, the pathfinding will be "
"broken."
msgstr ""
"ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະແປງເມັສສຳລັບສະແດງຜົນໃຫ້ເປັນ navigation mesh, ກະລຸນາກວດສອບ:\n"
"\n"
"- ເມັສເປັນແບບສອງມິຕິ (two-dimensional).\n"
"- ເມັສບໍ່ມີພື້ນຜິວຊ້ອນທັບກັນ.\n"
"- ເມັສບໍ່ມີສ່ວນທີ່ຕັດກັນເອງ (self-intersection).\n"
"- ພື້ນຜິວຂອງເມັສມີ indices.\n"
"\n"
"ຫາກເມັສບໍ່ກົງຕາມເງື່ອນໄຂເຫຼົ່ານີ້, ລະບົບການຫາເສັ້ນທາງ (pathfinding) ຈະໃຊ້ງານບໍ່ໄດ້."

msgid "Add MeshLibrary item"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມລາຍການ MeshLibrary"

msgid "Remove MeshLibrary item"
msgstr "ລຶບລາຍການ MeshLibrary"

msgid ""
"Update from existing scene?:\n"
"%s"
msgstr ""
"ອັບເດດຈາກສາກທີ່ມີຢູ່ບໍ່?:\n"
"%s"

msgid "Import MeshLibrary from scene"
msgstr "ນຳເຂົ້າ MeshLibrary ຈາກສາກ"

msgid "MeshLibrary"
msgstr "MeshLibrary"

msgid "Import from Scene (Ignore Transforms)"
msgstr "ນຳເຂົ້າຈາກສາກ (ບໍ່ສົນໃຈການແປງຄ່າ/Transforms)"

msgid "Import from Scene (Apply Transforms)"
msgstr "ນຳເຂົ້າຈາກສາກ (ໃຊ້ການແປງຄ່າ/Transforms)"

msgid "Update from Scene"
msgstr "ອັບເດດຈາກສາກ"

msgid "Filter Meshes"
msgstr "ກອງເມັສ (Filter Meshes)"

msgid ""
"The item's name, shown in the editor. It can also be used to look up the item "
"later using [method MeshLibrary.find_item_by_name]."
msgstr ""
"ຊື່ຂອງລາຍການ, ສະແດງຢູ່ໃນ editor. ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຄົ້ນຫາລາຍການໃນພາຍຫຼັງໂດຍໃຊ້ [method "
"MeshLibrary.find_item_by_name]."

msgid ""
"The item's mesh. Used by other parts of the engine (e.g. [GridMap], which "
"displays them in a 3D tile)."
msgstr ""
"ເມັສຂອງລາຍການ. ໃຊ້ໂດຍສ່ວນອື່ນໆຂອງ engine (ເຊັ່ນ [GridMap], ເຊິ່ງຈະສະແດງ ພວກມັນໃນຮູບແບບ "
"3D tile)."

msgid "The transform to apply to the item's mesh."
msgstr "ການແປງຄ່າ (transform) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ກັບເມັສຂອງລາຍການ."

msgid ""
"The shadow casting mode used by the item's mesh. See [enum "
"RenderingServer.ShadowCastingSetting]."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດການເກີດເງົາທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍເມັສຂອງລາຍການ. ເບິ່ງ [enum "
"RenderingServer.ShadowCastingSetting]."

msgid ""
"The item's collision shapes.\n"
"The array should consist of [Shape3D] objects, each followed by a "
"[Transform3D] that will be applied to it. For shapes that should not have a "
"transform, use [constant Transform3D.IDENTITY]."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບຊົງຄໍລິຊັນຂອງລາຍການ.\n"
"ອາເຣ (array) ຄວນປະກອບດ້ວຍວັດຖຸ [Shape3D], ເຊິ່ງແຕ່ລະອັນຈະຕາມດ້ວຍ [Transform3D] "
"ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ກັບມັນ. ສຳລັບຮູບຊົງທີ່ບໍ່ຕ້ອງການການແປງຄ່າ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [constant Transform3D.IDENTITY]."

msgid "The item's navigation mesh."
msgstr "Navigation mesh ຂອງລາຍການ."

msgid "The transform to apply to the item's navigation mesh."
msgstr "ການແປງຄ່າ (transform) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ກັບ navigation mesh ຂອງລາຍການ."

msgid "The item's navigation layers bitmask."
msgstr "bitmask ຂອງ navigation layers ຂອງລາຍການ."

msgid "The texture to use as the item's preview icon in the editor."
msgstr "ເທັກເຈີທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເປັນໄອຄອນຕົວຢ່າງຂອງລາຍການໃນ editor."

msgid ""
"No items found inside the MeshLibrary.\n"
"You can add some by using the Add button on the left, or by importing them "
"from a scene file via the Import menu."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ພົບລາຍການໃດໆພາຍໃນ MeshLibrary.\n"
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດເພີ່ມໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ປຸ່ມ Add ຢູ່ທາງຊ້າຍ, ຫຼື ໂດຍການນຳເຂົ້າຈາກ ໄຟລ໌ສາກຜ່ານເມນູ Import."

msgid "Apply without Transforms"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ງານໂດຍບໍ່ມີການແປງຄ່າ (Transforms)"

msgid "Apply with Transforms"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ງານພ້ອມກັບການແປງຄ່າ (Transforms)"

