msgid "Directional Shadow Splits"
msgstr "ການແຍກເງົາແນວທາງ (Directional Shadow Splits)"

msgid ""
"Displays directional shadow splits in different colors to make adjusting "
"split thresholds easier. \n"
"Red: 1st split (closest to the camera), Green: 2nd split, Blue: 3rd split, "
"Yellow: 4th split (furthest from the camera)"
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງການແຍກເງົາແນວທາງໃນສີທີ່ຕ່າງກັນເພື່ອໃຫ້ປັບຄ່າ split thresholds ໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ. \n"
"ສີແດງ: ສ່ວນແຍກທີ 1 (ໃກ້ກ້ອງທີ່ສຸດ), ສີຂຽວ: ສ່ວນແຍກທີ 2, ສີນ້ຳເງິນ: ສ່ວນແຍກທີ 3, ສີເຫຼືອງ: "
"ສ່ວນແຍກທີ 4 (ໄກຈາກກ້ອງທີ່ສຸດ)"

msgid "Normal Buffer"
msgstr "Normal Buffer"

msgid "Shadow Atlas"
msgstr "Shadow Atlas"

msgid ""
"Displays the shadow atlas used for positional (omni/spot) shadow mapping.\n"
"Requires a visible OmniLight3D or SpotLight3D node with shadows enabled to "
"have a visible effect."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງ shadow atlas ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການເຮັດ shadow mapping ແບບກຳນົດຕຳແໜ່ງ (omni/spot).\n"
"ຕ້ອງມີ OmniLight3D ຫຼື SpotLight3D ທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ເງົາຢູ່ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຫັນຜົນ."

msgid "Directional Shadow Map"
msgstr "Directional Shadow Map"

msgid ""
"Displays the shadow map used for directional shadow mapping.\n"
"Requires a visible DirectionalLight3D node with shadows enabled to have a "
"visible effect."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງ shadow map ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການເຮັດ directional shadow mapping.\n"
"ຕ້ອງມີ DirectionalLight3D ທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ເງົາຢູ່ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຫັນຜົນ."

msgid "Decal Atlas"
msgstr "Decal Atlas"

msgid "AreaLight3D Atlas"
msgstr "AreaLight3D Atlas"

msgid "VoxelGI Lighting"
msgstr "VoxelGI Lighting"

msgid ""
"Requires a visible VoxelGI node that has been baked to have a visible effect."
msgstr "ຕ້ອງມີ VoxelGI node ທີ່ຖືກ bake ແລ້ວເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຫັນຜົນ."

msgid "VoxelGI Albedo"
msgstr "VoxelGI Albedo"

msgid "VoxelGI Emission"
msgstr "VoxelGI Emission"

msgid "SDFGI Cascades"
msgstr "SDFGI Cascades"

msgid "Requires SDFGI to be enabled in Environment to have a visible effect."
msgstr "ຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ SDFGI ໃນ Environment ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຫັນຜົນ."

msgid "SDFGI Probes"
msgstr "SDFGI Probes"

msgid ""
"Left-click a SDFGI probe to display its occlusion information (white = not "
"occluded, red = fully occluded).\n"
"Requires SDFGI to be enabled in Environment to have a visible effect."
msgstr ""
"ຄລິກຊ້າຍທີ່ SDFGI probe ເພື່ອສະແດງຂໍ້ມູນການບັງ (occlusion) (ສີຂາວ = ບໍ່ຖືກບັງ, ສີແດງ = "
"ຖືກບັງທັງໝົດ).\n"
"ຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ SDFGI ໃນ Environment ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຫັນຜົນ."

msgid "Scene Luminance"
msgstr "ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງສາກ (Scene Luminance)"

msgid ""
"Displays the scene luminance computed from the 3D buffer. This is used for "
"Auto Exposure calculation.\n"
"Requires Auto Exposure to be enabled in CameraAttributes to have a visible "
"effect."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງສາກທີ່ຄຳນວນຈາກ 3D buffer. ສິ່ງນີ້ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຄຳນວນ Auto Exposure.\n"
"ຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ Auto Exposure ໃນ CameraAttributes ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຫັນຜົນ."

msgid "SSAO"
msgstr "SSAO"

msgid ""
"Displays the screen-space ambient occlusion buffer. Requires SSAO to be "
"enabled in Environment to have a visible effect."
msgstr "ສະແດງ SSAO buffer. ຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ SSAO ໃນ Environment ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຫັນຜົນ."

msgid "SSIL"
msgstr "SSIL"

msgid ""
"Displays the screen-space indirect lighting buffer. Requires SSIL to be "
"enabled in Environment to have a visible effect."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງ screen-space indirect lighting buffer. ຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ SSIL ໃນ Environment "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຫັນຜົນ."

msgid "VoxelGI/SDFGI Buffer"
msgstr "VoxelGI/SDFGI Buffer"

msgid "Requires SDFGI or VoxelGI to be enabled to have a visible effect."
msgstr "ຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ SDFGI ຫຼື VoxelGI ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຫັນຜົນ."

msgid "Disable Mesh LOD"
msgstr "ປິດໃຊ້ Mesh LOD"

msgid ""
"Renders all meshes with their highest level of detail regardless of their "
"distance from the camera."
msgstr "ປະມວນຜົນທຸກເມັສດ້ວຍລະດັບລາຍລະອຽດສູງສຸດ ໂດຍບໍ່ສົນໃຈໄລຍະຫ່າງຈາກກ້ອງ."

msgid "OmniLight3D Cluster"
msgstr "OmniLight3D Cluster"

msgid ""
"Highlights tiles of pixels that are affected by at least one OmniLight3D."
msgstr "ເນັ້ນພິກເຊວທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກ OmniLight3D ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງອັນ."

msgid "SpotLight3D Cluster"
msgstr "SpotLight3D Cluster"

msgid ""
"Highlights tiles of pixels that are affected by at least one SpotLight3D."
msgstr "ເນັ້ນພິກເຊວທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກ SpotLight3D ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງອັນ."

msgid "AreaLight3D Cluster"
msgstr "AreaLight3D Cluster"

msgid ""
"Highlights tiles of pixels that are affected by at least one AreaLight3D."
msgstr "ເນັ້ນພິກເຊວທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກ AreaLight3D ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງອັນ."

msgid "Decal Cluster"
msgstr "Decal Cluster"

msgid "Highlights tiles of pixels that are affected by at least one Decal."
msgstr "ເນັ້ນພິກເຊວທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກ Decal ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງອັນ."

msgid "ReflectionProbe Cluster"
msgstr "ReflectionProbe Cluster"

msgid ""
"Highlights tiles of pixels that are affected by at least one ReflectionProbe."
msgstr "ເນັ້ນພິກເຊວທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກ ReflectionProbe ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງອັນ."

msgid "Occlusion Culling Buffer"
msgstr "Occlusion Culling Buffer"

msgid ""
"Represents occluders with black pixels. Requires occlusion culling to be "
"enabled to have a visible effect."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງຕົວບັງ (occluders) ດ້ວຍພິກເຊວສີດຳ. ຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ occlusion culling ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຫັນຜົນ."

msgid "Motion Vectors"
msgstr "Motion Vectors"

msgid ""
"Represents motion vectors with colored lines in the direction of motion. Gray "
"dots represent areas with no per-pixel motion."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງ motion vectors ດ້ວຍເສັ້ນສີຕາມທິດທາງການເຄື່ອນທີ່. ຈຸດສີເທົາໝາຍເຖິງພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ບໍ່ມີການເຄື່ອນທີ່."

msgid "Internal Buffer"
msgstr "Internal Buffer"

msgid ""
"Shows the scene rendered in linear colorspace before any tonemapping or post-"
"processing."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງສາກທີ່ຖືກປະມວນຜົນໃນ linear colorspace ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະມີການເຮັດ tonemapping ຫຼື post-"
"processing."

msgid "Display Advanced..."
msgstr "ການສະແດງຜົນຂັ້ນສູງ..."

msgid "View Environment"
msgstr "ສະແດງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ (Environment)"

msgid "View Gizmos"
msgstr "ສະແດງ Gizmos"

msgid "View Transform Gizmo"
msgstr "ສະແດງ Transform Gizmo"

msgid "View Grid"
msgstr "ສະແດງຕາຕະລາງ (Grid)"

msgid "View Information"
msgstr "ສະແດງຂໍ້ມູນ"

msgid "View Frame Time"
msgstr "ສະແດງເວລາເຟຣມ (Frame Time)"

msgid "Half Resolution"
msgstr "ຄວາມລະອຽດເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງ"

msgid "Audio Listener"
msgstr "Audio Listener"

msgid "Enable Doppler"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ Doppler"

msgid "Cinematic Preview"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງແບບຮູບເງົາ (Cinematic Preview)"

msgid ""
"Press Focus Selection twice to start following the selection as it moves. "
"Press it yet another time to stop following the selection."
msgstr ""
"ກົດ Focus Selection ສອງຄັ້ງເພື່ອເລີ່ມຕິດຕາມສິ່ງທີ່ເລືອກໃນຂະນະທີ່ມັນເຄື່ອນທີ່. ກົດອີກຄັ້ງເພື່ອຢຸດການຕິດຕາມ."

msgid "Lock Transformation to X axis"
msgstr "ລັອກການ Transform ໄວ້ທີ່ແກນ X"

msgid "Lock Transformation to Y axis"
msgstr "ລັອກການ Transform ໄວ້ທີ່ແກນ Y"

msgid "Lock Transformation to Z axis"
msgstr "ລັອກການ Transform ໄວ້ທີ່ແກນ Z"

msgid "Lock Transformation to YZ plane"
msgstr "ລັອກການ Transform ໄວ້ທີ່ລະນາບ YZ"

msgid "Lock Transformation to XZ plane"
msgstr "ລັອກການ Transform ໄວ້ທີ່ລະນາບ XZ"

msgid "Lock Transformation to XY plane"
msgstr "ລັອກການ Transform ໄວ້ທີ່ລະນາບ XY"

msgid "Cancel Transformation"
msgstr "ຍົກເລີກການ Transform"

msgid "Begin Translate Transformation"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມການ Translate"

msgid "Begin Rotate Transformation"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມການ Rotate"

msgid "Begin Scale Transformation"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມການ Scale"

msgid "Reposition Using Collisions"
msgstr "ຈັດຕຳແໜ່ງໃໝ່ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄໍລິຊັນ (Collisions)"

msgid "Click to stop following this node as it moves."
msgstr "ຄລິກເພື່ອຢຸດການຕິດຕາມ node ນີ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ມັນເຄື່ອນທີ່."

msgid ""
"Preview through the selected camera.\n"
"Hold Shift while clicking to also enable Pilot mode."
msgstr ""
"ເບິ່ງຕົວຢ່າງຜ່ານກ້ອງທີ່ເລືອກ.\n"
"ກົດ Shift ຄ້າງໄວ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຄລິກເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ໂໝດ Pilot."

msgid "Toggle Camera Preview"
msgstr "ເປີດ/ປິດ ຕົວຢ່າງຈາກກ້ອງ"

msgid "Pilot"
msgstr "Pilot"

msgid ""
"Enable pilot mode for the preview camera.\n"
"Allows WASD movement and mouse look when in preview mode."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໃຊ້ໂໝດ pilot ສຳລັບກ້ອງຕົວຢ່າງ.\n"
"ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ໃຊ້ WASD ເຄື່ອນທີ່ ແລະ ໃຊ້ເມົາສ໌ເບິ່ງໄປມາໄດ້ໃນໂໝດຕົວຢ່າງ."

msgid "Toggle Pilot Mode in Preview"
msgstr "ເປີດ/ປິດ ໂໝດ Pilot ໃນການເບິ່ງຕົວຢ່າງ"

msgid "View Rotation Locked"
msgstr "ລັອກການໝູນຂອງມຸມເບິ່ງແລ້ວ"

msgid ""
"To zoom further, change the camera's clipping planes (View → Settings...)"
msgstr "ເພື່ອຊູມໃຫ້ໄກກວ່າເກົ່າ, ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນຄ່າ clipping planes ຂອງກ້ອງ (View → Settings...)"

msgid ""
"Hold %s to highlight a vertex on the currently selected node,\n"
"then drag to move the node and snap it to vertices on neighboring nodes.\n"
"\n"
"For nodes without a vertex-based representation,\n"
"Snap Origin to Vertex is always used instead."
msgstr ""
"ກົດ %s ຄ້າງໄວ້ເພື່ອເນັ້ນ vertex ໃນ node ທີ່ເລືອກ,\n"
"ຈາກນັ້ນລາກເພື່ອຍ້າຍ node ແລະ ໃຫ້ມັນ snap ເຂົ້າກັບ vertex ຂອງ node ໃກ້ຄຽງ.\n"
"\n"
"ສຳລັບ node ທີ່ບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນ vertex,\n"
"ຈະໃຊ້ Snap Origin to Vertex ແທນສະເໝີ."

msgid ""
"Hold %s to highlight another node's vertex,\n"
"then click to teleport the selected node to the highlighted vertex."
msgstr ""
"ກົດ %s ຄ້າງໄວ້ເພື່ອເນັ້ນ vertex ຂອງ node ອື່ນ,\n"
"ຈາກນັ້ນຄລິກເພື່ອຍ້າຍ node ທີ່ເລືອກໄປຍັງ vertex ທີ່ເນັ້ນໄວ້ທັນທີ."

msgid ""
"Snap to vertices of visual meshes.\n"
"Hold Shift while vertex snapping to temporarily snap to collision shapes "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"Snap ເຂົ້າກັບ vertex ຂອງ visual meshes.\n"
"ກົດ Shift ຄ້າງໄວ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ເຮັດ vertex snapping ເພື່ອ snap ເຂົ້າກັບ collision shapes "
"ແທນຊົ່ວຄາວ."

msgid ""
"Snap to vertices of collision shapes.\n"
"Hold Shift while vertex snapping to temporarily snap to mesh vertices instead."
msgstr ""
"Snap ເຂົ້າກັບ vertex ຂອງ collision shapes.\n"
"ກົດ Shift ຄ້າງໄວ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ເຮັດ vertex snapping ເພື່ອ snap ເຂົ້າກັບ mesh vertices "
"ແທນຊົ່ວຄາວ."

msgid "XForm Dialog"
msgstr "XForm Dialog"

msgid "Lock Selected"
msgstr "ລັອກສິ່ງທີ່ເລືອກ"

msgid "Unlock Selected"
msgstr "ປົດລັອກສິ່ງທີ່ເລືອກ"

msgid "Group Selected"
msgstr "ຈັດກຸ່ມສິ່ງທີ່ເລືອກ"

msgid "Ungroup Selected"
msgstr "ຍົກເລີກການຈັດກຸ່ມສິ່ງທີ່ເລືອກ"

msgid ""
"Click to toggle between visibility states.\n"
"\n"
"Open eye: Gizmo is visible.\n"
"Closed eye: Gizmo is hidden.\n"
"Half-open eye: Gizmo is also visible through opaque surfaces (\"x-ray\")."
msgstr ""
"ຄລິກເພື່ອປ່ຽນສະຖານະການເບິ່ງເຫັນ.\n"
"\n"
"ຮູບຕາເປີດ: Gizmo ຈະເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້.\n"
"ຮູບຕາປິດ: Gizmo ຈະຖືກເຊື່ອງ.\n"
"ຮູບຕາເປີດເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງ: Gizmo ຈະເບິ່ງເຫັນທະລຸພື້ນຜິວທຶບແສງໄດ້ (\"x-ray\")."

msgid "Snap Nodes to Floor"
msgstr "Snap Node ລົງໃສ່ພື້ນ"

msgid "Couldn't find a solid floor to snap the selection to."
msgstr "ບໍ່ພົບພື້ນຜິວທີ່ແຂງແກ່ນເພື່ອ snap ສິ່ງທີ່ເລືອກລົງໄປໃສ່."

msgid "Add Preview Sun to Scene"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມດວງອາທິດຈຳລອງໃສ່ໃນສາກ"

msgid "Add Preview Environment to Scene"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຈຳລອງໃສ່ໃນສາກ"

msgid "Alt+RMB: Show list of all nodes at position clicked, including locked."
msgstr "Alt+ຄລິກຂວາ: ສະແດງລາຍຊື່ node ທັງໝົດໃນຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ຄລິກ, ລວມທັງອັນທີ່ຖືກລັອກ."

msgid "%s+Drag: Rotate selected node around pivot."
msgstr "%s+ລາກ: ໝູນ node ທີ່ເລືອກອ້ອມຮອບຈຸດໝູນ (pivot)."

msgid "%s+Drag: Use snap."
msgstr "%s+ລາກ: ໃຊ້ snap."

msgid "LMB+Drag: Measure the distance between two points in 3D space."
msgstr "ຄລິກຊ້າຍ+ລາກ: ແທກໄລຍະຫ່າງລະຫວ່າງສອງຈຸດໃນພື້ນທີ່ 3D."

msgid ""
"Scene contains\n"
"DirectionalLight3D.\n"
"Preview disabled."
msgstr ""
"ສາກມີ\n"
"DirectionalLight3D.\n"
"ປິດການເບິ່ງຕົວຢ່າງ."

msgid "Preview disabled."
msgstr "ປິດການເບິ່ງຕົວຢ່າງ."

msgid ""
"Scene contains\n"
"WorldEnvironment.\n"
"Preview disabled."
msgstr ""
"ສາກມີ\n"
"WorldEnvironment.\n"
"ປິດການເບິ່ງຕົວຢ່າງ."

msgid "Set Preview Sun Direction"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າທິດທາງດວງອາທິດຈຳລອງ"

msgid "Set Preview Sun Altitude"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າລະດັບຄວາມສູງດວງອາທິດຈຳລອງ"

msgid "Set Preview Sun Azimuth"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າທິດທາງມຸມ (Azimuth) ດວງອາທິດຈຳລອງ"

msgid "Set Preview Sun Color"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າສີດວງອາທິດຈຳລອງ"

msgid "Set Preview Sun Energy"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າພະລັງງານ/ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງດວງອາທິດຈຳລອງ"

msgid "Set Preview Sun Max Shadow Distance"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄລຍະເງົາສູງສຸດຂອງດວງອາທິດໃນຕົວຢ່າງ"

msgid "Set Preview Environment Sky Color"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າສີທ້ອງຟ້າຂອງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໃນຕົວຢ່າງ"

msgid "Set Preview Environment Ground Color"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າສີພື້ນຂອງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໃນຕົວຢ່າງ"

msgid "Set Preview Environment Energy"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າພະລັງງານຂອງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໃນຕົວຢ່າງ"

msgid "Set Preview Environment Ambient Occlusion"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ Ambient Occlusion ຂອງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໃນຕົວຢ່າງ"

msgid "Set Preview Environment Glow"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າການເຮືອງແສງ (Glow) ຂອງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໃນຕົວຢ່າງ"

msgid "Set Preview Environment Tonemap"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ Tonemap ຂອງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໃນຕົວຢ່າງ"

msgid "Set Preview Environment Global Illumination"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າການສ່ອງສະຫວ່າງທົ່ວໂລກ (GI) ຂອງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໃນຕົວຢ່າງ"

msgid "Transform Mode"
msgstr "ໂໝດປັບປ່ຽນຮູບຊົງ"

msgid "Move Mode"
msgstr "ໂໝດຍ້າຍ"

msgid "Rotate Mode"
msgstr "ໂໝດໝຸນ"

msgid "Scale Mode"
msgstr "ໂໝດປັບຂະໜາດ"

msgid "Select Mode"
msgstr "ໂໝດເລືອກ"

msgid "Show List of Selectable Nodes"
msgstr "ສະແດງລາຍການໂນດທີ່ເລືອກໄດ້"

msgid "Lock selected node, preventing selection and movement."
msgstr "ລັອກໂນດທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້ ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນການເລືອກ ແລະ ການເຄື່ອນຍ້າຍ."

msgid "Lock"
msgstr "ລັອກ"

msgid "Unlock selected node, allowing selection and movement."
msgstr "ປົດລັອກໂນດທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດເລືອກ ແລະ ເຄື່ອນຍ້າຍໄດ້."

msgid "Unlock"
msgstr "ປົດລັອກ"

msgid ""
"Groups the selected node with its children. This selects the parent when any "
"child node is clicked in 2D and 3D view."
msgstr ""
"ຈັດກຸ່ມໂນດທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້ກັບໂນດລູກຂອງມັນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ໂນດແມ່ຖືກເລືອກ ເມື່ອຄລິກໃສ່ໂນດລູກໃດໜຶ່ງໃນມຸມເບິ່ງ 2D "
"ແລະ 3D."

msgid "Group"
msgstr "ກຸ່ມ"

msgid ""
"Ungroups the selected node from its children. Child nodes will be individual "
"items in 2D and 3D view."
msgstr ""
"ຍົກເລີກການຈັດກຸ່ມໂນດທີ່ເລືອກອອກຈາກໂນດລູກຂອງມັນ. ໂນດລູກຈະກາຍເປັນລາຍການແຍກຕ່າງຫາກໃນມຸມເບິ່ງ 2D "
"ແລະ 3D."

msgid "Ungroup"
msgstr "ຍົກເລີກກຸ່ມ"

msgid "Ruler Mode"
msgstr "ໂໝດໄມ້ບັນທັດ"

msgid "Use Local Space"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ພື້ນທີ່ໂລໂຄລ (Local Space)"

msgid "Use Snap"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ການຢຶດ (Snap)"

msgid "Use Trackball"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ແທຣັກບອລ (Trackball)"

msgid "Preserve Children Transform"
msgstr "ຮັກສາການປ່ຽນຮູບຊົງຂອງໂນດລູກ"

msgid ""
"When enabled, transforming a node will preserve the global transform of its "
"children.\n"
"This also applies when editing transform properties in the Inspector."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານ, ການປ່ຽນຮູບຊົງຂອງໂນດຈະຮັກສາຮູບຊົງແບບໂກລບອລ (Global) ຂອງໂນດລູກໄວ້.\n"
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຍັງມີຜົນເມື່ອແກ້ໄຂຄຸນສົມບັດການແປງຮູບຊົງໃນ Inspector."

msgid ""
"Toggle preview sunlight.\n"
"If a DirectionalLight3D node is added to the scene, preview sunlight is "
"disabled."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດ/ປິດ ຕົວຢ່າງແສງຕາເວັນ.\n"
"ຖ້າມີໂນດ DirectionalLight3D ຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນສາກ, ແສງຕາເວັນຕົວຢ່າງຈະຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid "Toggle preview sunlight."
msgstr "ເປີດ/ປິດ ຕົວຢ່າງແສງຕາເວັນ."

msgid ""
"Toggle preview environment.\n"
"If a WorldEnvironment node is added to the scene, preview environment is "
"disabled."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດ/ປິດ ຕົວຢ່າງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ.\n"
"ຖ້າມີໂນດ WorldEnvironment ຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນສາກ, ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຕົວຢ່າງຈະຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid "Toggle preview environment."
msgstr "ເປີດ/ປິດ ຕົວຢ່າງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ."

msgid "Edit Sun and Environment settings."
msgstr "ແກ້ໄຂການຕັ້ງຄ່າແສງຕາເວັນ ແລະ ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ."

msgid "Bottom View"
msgstr "ມຸມເບິ່ງດ້ານລຸ່ມ"

msgid "Top View"
msgstr "ມຸມເບິ່ງດ້ານເທິງ"

msgid "Rear View"
msgstr "ມຸມເບິ່ງດ້ານຫຼັງ"

msgid "Front View"
msgstr "ມຸມເບິ່ງດ້ານໜ້າ"

msgid "Left View"
msgstr "ມຸມເບິ່ງດ້ານຊ້າຍ"

msgid "Right View"
msgstr "ມຸມເບິ່ງດ້ານຂວາ"

msgid "Orbit View Down"
msgstr "ໝຸນມຸມເບິ່ງລົງ"

msgid "Orbit View Left"
msgstr "ໝຸນມຸມເບິ່ງໄປທາງຊ້າຍ"

msgid "Orbit View Right"
msgstr "ໝຸນມຸມເບິ່ງໄປທາງຂວາ"

msgid "Orbit View Up"
msgstr "ໝຸນມຸມເບິ່ງຂຶ້ນ"

msgid "Orbit View 180"
msgstr "ໝຸນມຸມເບິ່ງ 180 ອົງສາ"

msgid "Switch Perspective/Orthogonal View"
