"ການປະມວນຜົນການສະແດງຜົນໂດຍອີງໃສ່ RenderingDevice (ຫາກປິດໃຊ້ງານ, ຈະຕ້ອງໃຊ້ OpenGL "
"backend ແທນ)."

msgid "Forward+ renderer for advanced 3D graphics."
msgstr "ຕົວປະມວນຜົນການສະແດງຜົນ Forward+ ສຳລັບກຣາຟິກ 3D ຂັ້ນສູງ."

msgid "Mobile renderer for less advanced 3D graphics."
msgstr "ຕົວປະມວນຜົນການສະແດງຜົນມືຖືສຳລັບກຣາຟິກ 3D ທີ່ບໍ່ຊັບຊ້ອນປານໃດ."

msgid "Vulkan backend of RenderingDevice."
msgstr "Vulkan backend ຂອງ RenderingDevice."

msgid "Direct3D 12 backend of RenderingDevice."
msgstr "Direct3D 12 backend ຂອງ RenderingDevice."

msgid "Metal backend of RenderingDevice (Apple arm64 only)."
msgstr "Metal backend ຂອງ RenderingDevice (ສຳລັບ Apple arm64 ເທົ່ານັ້ນ)."

msgid "OpenGL backend (if disabled, the RenderingDevice backend is required)."
msgstr "OpenGL backend (ຫາກປິດໃຊ້ງານ, ຈະຕ້ອງໃຊ້ RenderingDevice backend ແທນ)."

msgid "PhysicsServer and capabilities for 2D."
msgstr "PhysicsServer ແລະ ຄວາມສາມາດສຳລັບ 2D."

msgid "Godot Physics backend (2D)."
msgstr "Godot Physics backend (2D)."

msgid "PhysicsServer and capabilities for 3D."
msgstr "PhysicsServer ແລະ ຄວາມສາມາດສຳລັບ 3D."

msgid "Godot Physics backend (3D)."
msgstr "Godot Physics backend (3D)."

msgid "Jolt Physics backend (3D only)."
msgstr "Jolt Physics backend (ສຳລັບ 3D ເທົ່ານັ້ນ)."

msgid ""
"Fallback implementation of Text Server\n"
"Supports basic text layouts."
msgstr ""
"ການຕິດຕັ້ງແບບສຳຮອງຂອງເຊີເວີຂໍ້ຄວາມ\n"
"ຮອງຮັບການຈັດວາງຂໍ້ຄວາມພື້ນຖານ."

msgid ""
"Text Server implementation powered by ICU and HarfBuzz libraries.\n"
"Supports complex text layouts, BiDi, and contextual OpenType font features."
msgstr ""
"ການຕິດຕັ້ງເຊີເວີຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຂັບເຄື່ອນໂດຍໄລບຣາຣີ ICU ແລະ HarfBuzz.\n"
"ຮອງຮັບການຈັດວາງຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນ, BiDi, ແລະຄຸນສົມບັດຟອນຕ໌ OpenType ຕາມບໍລິບົດ."

msgid ""
"TrueType, OpenType, Type 1, and WOFF1 font format support using FreeType "
"library (if disabled, WOFF2 support is also disabled)."
msgstr ""
"ຮອງຮັບຮູບແບບຟອນຕ໌ TrueType, OpenType, Type 1, ແລະ WOFF1 ໂດຍໃຊ້ໄລບຣາຣີ FreeType "
"(ຫາກປິດໃຊ້ງານ, ການຮອງຮັບ WOFF2 ກໍຈະຖືກປິດໄປນຳ)."

msgid "WOFF2 font format support using FreeType and Brotli libraries."
msgstr "ຮອງຮັບຮູບແບບຟອນຕ໌ WOFF2 ໂດຍໃຊ້ໄລບຣາຣີ FreeType ແລະ Brotli."

msgid ""
"SIL Graphite smart font technology support (supported by Advanced Text Server "
"only)."
msgstr "ຮອງຮັບເຕັກໂນໂລຊີຟອນຕ໌ອັດສະລິຍະ SIL Graphite (ຮອງຮັບໂດຍເຊີເວີຂໍ້ຄວາມຂັ້ນສູງເທົ່ານັ້ນ)."

msgid ""
"Multi-channel signed distance field font rendering support using msdfgen "
"library (pre-rendered MSDF fonts can be used even if this option is disabled)."
msgstr ""
"ຮອງຮັບການປະມວນຜົນການສະແດງຜົນຟອນຕ໌ແບບ Multi-channel signed distance field "
"ໂດຍໃຊ້ໄລບຣາຣີ msdfgen (ສາມາດໃຊ້ຟອນຕ໌ MSDF ທີ່ປະມວນຜົນໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າໄດ້ "
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະປິດທາງເລືອກນີ້ກໍຕາມ)."

