msgid "App Store distribution with ad-hoc code signing is not supported."
msgstr "ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບການແຈກຢາຍຜ່ານ App Store ດ້ວຍການເຊັນລະຫັດແບບ ad-hoc."

msgid "Notarization with an ad-hoc signature is not supported."
msgstr "ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບການຮັບຮອງ (Notarization) ດ້ວຍລາຍເຊັນແບບ ad-hoc."

msgid "Apple Team ID is required for App Store distribution."
msgstr "ຕ້ອງມີ Apple Team ID ສຳລັບການແຈກຢາຍຜ່ານ App Store."

msgid "Apple Team ID is required for notarization."
msgstr "ຕ້ອງມີ Apple Team ID ສຳລັບການຮັບຮອງ (Notarization)."

