"'rcodesign' doesn't support signing applications with embedded dynamic "
"libraries (GDExtension or .NET)."
msgstr ""
"'rcodesign' ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບການເຊັນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ມີໄລບຣາຣີແບບໄດນາມິກຝັງຢູ່ (GDExtension ຫຼື .NET)."

